@	
o	-e|--exec	A line of code to execute in context before the session starts	v
o	--no-pager	Disable pager for long output	
o	--no-history	Disable history loading	
o	--no-color	Disable syntax highlighting for session	
o	-f	Suppress loading of pryrc	
o	-s|--select-plugin	Only load specified plugin (and no others)	v
o	-d|--disable-plugin	Disable a specific plugin	v
o	--no-plugins	Suppress loading of plugins	
o	--plugins	List installed plugins	
o	--simple-prompt	Enable simple prompt mode	
o	--noprompt	No prompt mode	
o	-r|--require	`require` a Ruby script at startup	v
o	-I	Add a path to the $LOAD_PATH	v
o	--gem	Shorthand for -I./lib -rgemname	v
o	-v|--version	Display the Pry version	
o	-c|--context	Start the session in the specified context. Equivalent to `context.pry` in a session	v
o	-h|--help	Display this help message	
